permit (principal is User, action == Action::"approveChange", resource is ChangeRequest) when { principal.grantedChangeAuthorityLevel >= resource.assessedRisk && ((resource.estimatedCostCents < context.cabSignoffCostThresholdCents && (principal.isChangeManager || principal.isCabApprover)) || (resource.estimatedCostCents >= context.cabSignoffCostThresholdCents && principal.isCabApprover)) };